{"4842880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HushWood", "steam_appid": 4842880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Welcome to <strong>Hushwood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations! You have successfully joined our team as the ranger of a remote forest reserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your responsibilities are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Patrol</strong> the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📷 <strong>Photograph</strong> anything of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 <strong>Submit</strong> daily reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Maintain</strong> equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥾 <strong>Explore</strong> the surrounding area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Maintain</strong> order and cleanliness within the reserve grounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the <strong>conscientious</strong> performance of your duties, employees are granted a <strong>service reward</strong>.<br>Access to the <strong>catalog</strong> of necessary goods is provided through the <strong>work computer</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.poster.avif?t=1786513876\" width=1094 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.webm?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.mp4?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All personnel are required to familiarize themselves with the response protocol for <strong>██████████████</strong>. Failure to comply with Section <strong>██.██</strong> may result in <strong>████████████████████</strong>. If you believe you have encountered <strong>████████████</strong>, remain calm and await further instructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.poster.avif?t=1786513876\" width=1094 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.webm?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.mp4?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is under control. <br>The Company has already received your previous reports. <br>They have all been carefully reviewed. <br>All reports concerning impossible objects have been determined to be unfounded. <br>Please continue your assigned duties! <br>🙂</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Welcome to <strong>Hushwood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations! You have successfully joined our team as the ranger of a remote forest reserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your responsibilities are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Patrol</strong> the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📷 <strong>Photograph</strong> anything of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 <strong>Submit</strong> daily reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Maintain</strong> equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥾 <strong>Explore</strong> the surrounding area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Maintain</strong> order and cleanliness within the reserve grounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the <strong>conscientious</strong> performance of your duties, employees are granted a <strong>service reward</strong>.<br>Access to the <strong>catalog</strong> of necessary goods is provided through the <strong>work computer</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.poster.avif?t=1786513876\" width=1094 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.webm?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/e1a9f12f975a4ef0f43f87f4afaf5ad0.mp4?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All personnel are required to familiarize themselves with the response protocol for <strong>██████████████</strong>. Failure to comply with Section <strong>██.██</strong> may result in <strong>████████████████████</strong>. If you believe you have encountered <strong>████████████</strong>, remain calm and await further instructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.poster.avif?t=1786513876\" width=1094 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.webm?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/extras/65b991f429a20df2441e4614f308fee5.mp4?t=1786513876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is under control. <br>The Company has already received your previous reports. <br>They have all been carefully reviewed. <br>All reports concerning impossible objects have been determined to be unfounded. <br>Please continue your assigned duties! <br>🙂</p>", "short_description": "You are the new ranger of a quiet forest reserve. Carry out your daily duties, explore the dense forest, and document any violations you encounter. Of course, it's just an ordinary forest. Nothing unusual ever happens here 😉", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/1a5d80d3df52a56df646ccf5f1befad242b05a6c/header.jpg?t=1786513876", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/26bc705154933d9d0258e22ff6b48003af3a2482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786513876", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842880/26bc705154933d9d0258e22ff6b48003af3a2482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786513876", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<stro